# The Workshop gallery pass: the captures, taken on the sanctuary save "Nelims-tribe" carried by Sanctuary Backlot.
#   Submit-PickleRun.ps1 -Mod DalmatiansRenew -DepMap wsl-deps.sanctuary-z3.map -Filter 07-publication-shots -Language English
# Only 07-publication-shots.feature asks for it; it is skipped in every other pass. Run it in English: the Workshop page is English.
# Copy of SanctuaryBacklot/Tests/Pickle/wsl-deps.sanctuary.map (2026-10-17, owner rule: every mod of that map, none questioned),
# plus the Backlot itself (the fixture and the "Nelim's Sanctuary:" steps; the fixture must come from the Backlot only: two fixtures
# of that name fail Pickle) and ScreenshotMode (the map shown alone). Seeds: Tests/Pickle/config/sanctuary/ (copied from the Backlot).
# Nelim is the one colonist (Virginie).
nelim.sanctuarybacklot path:SanctuaryBacklot/Mod
nelim.pickletools.screenshotmode path:PickleTools/ScreenshotMode/Mod
nelim.pickletools.screenshotstudio path:PickleTools/ScreenshotStudio/Mod
nelim.pickletools.camerazoom path:PickleTools/CameraZoom/Mod
nelim.pickletools.stagedecor path:PickleTools/StageDecor/Mod
nelim.pickletools.coatsteps path:PickleTools/CoatSteps/Mod
nelim.pickletools.clearscreen path:PickleTools/ClearScreen/Mod
nelim.pickletools.colonistrace path:PickleTools/ColonistRace/Mod
nelim.pickletools.clickdiagnostics path:PickleTools/ClickDiagnostics/Mod
# Camera zoom (2026-10-25, NPT answer on ticket a126): the game bounds the camera root size at 11, so the framing steps read 11 and fail.
# SimpleCameraSetting lifts the bound with its default settings and the root size stays the drawn size (CameraZoom/README.md, tickets 54d3 and 46b3).
ray1203.SimpleCameraSetting 3232415388
# The bundle is committed under PickleTools/Mod: this shell replaces it, so the tools above are the only copy of their steps (see StandaloneBase).
nelim.pickletools   path:PickleTools/Tests/Pickle/StandaloneBase/Mod
# Minimum list, 2026-10-07/08 (owner). The staging activates in file order, then sorts by loadAfter/dependencies.
# Bodies and trousers, as proven by Venus Touch Waistlines' gallery pass WITHOUT TailorMade (VenusTouchWaistlines/docs/runs/2026-10-08_gallery-no-tailormade-1):
# Female Body Variants and Female Apparel Variants load BEFORE WDI (else their Naked_*_Female textures shadow WDI's); AB's Visible Pants is indispensable (without it Venus does nothing).
# Seeds: Tests/Pickle/config/sanctuary/ (AB's settings; Venus's, whose name must be Mod_local-<packageId>_<Class>.xml because it is staged by path:).
# Not staged: TailorMade (not needed), Apparel Paper Pattern (not required: AB lists it in loadAfter only), THIGAPPE (does the same fitting as Venus, dropped), Reel's textures (owner: not added), Kas.GeneralCollection (optional, Workshop id 3789119336).
tiagocc0.FemaleBodyVariants 3798082132
tiagocc0.FemaleApparelVariants 3799726535
wdi.realistic.bodies 3527486510
ab.vplrf 2986402536
nelim.venustouch.waistlines path:VenusTouchWaistlines/Mod
